# Excitable Slime from WRIGGLE., a hidden quest in the Undercity canals (new in
# Forever).
# Sources: Forever's quest data, quest 97583 (Horde races, Skyborne included)
# and NPC 269452 (giver and position); Forever's quest page for 97583 (the
# slime as reward); items.json (Boyle sells the sludge: 25 copper for a stack
# of 5, Forever's client data 1.60.1.70532); the quest notes
# (data/local/mechanics: many /dance tries, dance again when it tires).

step Nutritious Slime Sludge
  tip Buy Nutritious Slime Sludge from Boyle in the Undercity canals first (25 copper for a stack of 5): you hand it in as soon as the slime offers its quest.
  buy 278265 x1 npc 4612              -- Nutritious Slime Sludge: Boyle, in the canals

step WRIGGLE.
  tip Find an Excitable Slime, a little critter in the canal water beside Boyle, target it and /dance at it, again and again, until it dances back and offers WRIGGLE.; this takes many tries. Hand in the sludge right away. If the slime seems tired, /dance with it again before you hand in.
  accept 97583 "WRIGGLE." @57.4,63.6 live
  turnin 97583 "WRIGGLE." @57.4,63.6 live
  collect 275682 "Excitable Slime" @57.4,63.6 live
